{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/extras/Sprite-0001.png?t=1744169911\" /><strong>Timeborn</strong> is a <i>JRPG</i> inspired game where you explore a world where time has long since ceased and destroy a variety of powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to rid this world of the <i>void-beings</i> that have began to grow aggressive ever since the <i>Gilded Tower</i> arose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The combat is a classic <i>turn based</i> system where you are given a wide range of options to take down your foes including <i>stopping time</i> to unleash powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between fights you can explore a variety of environments such as a foggy forest, a dark city, and a clock tower gilded in gold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The games visuals are <i>2.5d</i> where <i>pixel art, 3d models, and voxel models</i> are used to create a variety of detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571630?t=1744169911","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/52d318eed7f10339928328ab44dcaa446b7db596/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744169911","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/888bf543c05544fe258f19752c0847f8957c7cca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744169911","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/888bf543c05544fe258f19752c0847f8957c7cca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744169911","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/extras/Sprite-0001.png?t=1744169911\" /><strong>Timeborn</strong> is a <i>JRPG</i> inspired game where you explore a world where time has long since ceased and destroy a variety of powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to rid this world of the <i>void-beings</i> that have began to grow aggressive ever since the <i>Gilded Tower</i> arose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The combat is a classic <i>turn based</i> system where you are given a wide range of options to take down your foes including <i>stopping time</i> to unleash powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between fights you can explore a variety of environments such as a foggy forest, a dark city, and a clock tower gilded in gold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The games visuals are <i>2.5d</i> where <i>pixel art, 3d models, and voxel models</i> are used to create a variety of detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Jacob Gislason"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/a27c981f273e52f5c2ea0d29c855f6130116b808/header.jpg?t=1744169911","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120668,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120668/movie480.mp4?t=1743449700","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120668/movie_max.mp4?t=1743449700"},"name":"Timeborn Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120668/048f20320c2ba8a57f21cc0d9a802d6469b74559/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743449700","webm":{"480":"ht